<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Freelance Baru - Platform Setoran Gmail Profesional</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0a;
      --bg-card: #111;
      --bg-card2: #1a1a1a;
      --purple: #7c3aed;
      --purple-light: #a78bfa;
      --purple-dark: #5b21b6;
      --text: #e2e8f0;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: #1e1e2e;
      --success: #10b981;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --warning: #f59e0b;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    /* ─── Navbar ─── */
    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .navbar .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-light), var(--purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .navbar .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
    .navbar .nav-links a {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-member {
      background: var(--purple);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .btn-member:hover { background: var(--purple-dark); }
    .btn-admin {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .btn-admin:hover { border-color: var(--purple); color: var(--purple-light); }

    /* ─── Hero ─── */
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 24px 60px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
      color: var(--purple-light);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-light), #c084fc);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .hero-buttons a {
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-hero-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--purple-dark));
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-hero-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.5); }
    .btn-hero-secondary {
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-hero-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--purple); color: var(--purple-light); }

    /* ─── Stats ─── */
    .stats-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .stat-item { text-align: center; }
    .stat-item .stat-num {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-light), #c084fc);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .stat-item .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    /* ─── Features ─── */
    .features {
      padding: 60px 24px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .features h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--purple); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .feature-card .icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ─── Steps ─── */
    .steps {
      padding: 60px 24px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .steps h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .steps-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .step-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .step-num {
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--purple-dark));
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }
    .step-card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ─── CTA ─── */
    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 24px 80px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .cta h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .cta p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .cta a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--purple-dark));
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .cta a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.5); }

    /* ─── Footer ─── */
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* ─── Floating Discord ─── */
    .discord-float {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #5865F2;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.4);
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 200;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    .discord-float:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }
    .discord-float svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; fill: #fff; }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.4); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 4px 35px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.7); }
    }

    /* ─── Mobile ─── */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .navbar { padding: 12px 16px; }
      .navbar .logo { font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .nav-links a { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
      .hero { padding: 40px 16px 30px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 0.95rem; }
      .stats-bar { gap: 20px; padding: 20px 16px; }
      .stat-item .stat-num { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .features, .steps { padding: 40px 16px; }
      .discord-float { width: 48px; height: 48px; bottom: 16px; right: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">⚡ FreelanceBaru</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/member-login" class="btn-member">Masuk Member</a>
      <a href="/admin-login" class="btn-admin">Admin</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="badge">🚀 Platform Aktif & Terpercaya 2026</div>
    <h1>Ubah Akun Gmail<br>Jadi <span>Penghasilan Nyata!</span></h1>
    <p>Platform setoran Gmail profesional #1 di Indonesia. Sistem transparan dengan verifikasi manual, proses akun 1-2 hari, dan pencairan dana 1-2 menit setelah disetujui.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="/member-register" class="btn-hero-primary">🚀 Daftar Gratis</a>
      <a href="/member-login" class="btn-hero-secondary">Masuk Akun</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <div class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num"><%= stats.members %>+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Member Aktif</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num"><%= stats.setoran %>+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Email Disetor</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">99%</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Tingkat Sukses</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="features">
    <h2>Kenapa Memilih Kami?</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">✅</div>
        <h3>Verifikasi Manual</h3>
        <p>Setiap setoran dicek langsung oleh tim kami. 100% transparan, tanpa pemotongan sepihak.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Proses 1-2 Hari</h3>
        <p>Akun Gmail diproses admin dalam estimasi 1-2 hari agar pengecekan tetap rapi dan aman.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">📋</div>
        <h3>Riwayat Lengkap</h3>
        <p>Pantau semua status email secara real-time. Rekam jejak ACC dan Ditolak tercatat rapi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">📋</div>
        <h3>Copy-Paste Massal</h3>
        <p>Ratusan email berantakan? Tempel semua sekaligus. Sistem cerdas kami langsung merapikannya.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Program Referral</h3>
        <p>Ajak teman dan dapatkan bonus komisi setiap kali teman berhasil melakukan setoran.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">💰</div>
        <h3>Pencairan 1-2 Menit</h3>
        <p>Setelah akun disetujui, pencairan dana ke e-wallet atau rekening diproses sekitar 1-2 menit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="steps">
    <h2>3 Langkah Super Gampang</h2>
    <div class="steps-row">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3>Daftar Akun</h3>
        <p>Buat akun member, verifikasi dengan OTP, lalu masuk ke dashboard untuk mulai menyetor Gmail.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3>Setor Gmail</h3>
        <p>Paste akun Gmail sesuai format. Sistem akan merapikan input sebelum dikirim ke admin.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3>Tunggu & Cairkan</h3>
        <p>Akun diproses admin 1-2 hari. Setelah ACC, pencairan dana diproses sekitar 1-2 menit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Siap Mulai Hasilkan Uang dari Gmail?</h2>
    <p>Daftar gratis, tidak ada biaya apapun. Mulai setoran pertamamu hari ini!</p>
    <a href="/member-register">Daftar Gratis Sekarang</a>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2026 FreelanceBaru — Platform Setoran Gmail Profesional</p>
  </footer>

  <!-- Floating Discord -->
  <a href="https://discord.gg/VhmgYdgxV" target="_blank" class="discord-float" title="Join Discord">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418z"/></svg>
  </a>

  <script>
    // Update server time
    async function updateTime() {
      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/server-time');
        const data = await res.json();
      } catch (e) {}
    }
    setInterval(updateTime, 30000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
